1215
01:09:25,870 --> 01:09:27,872
(PANICKED SCREAMING)

1216
01:09:39,467 --> 01:09:40,468
(FRIAR SPEAKING)

1217
01:09:43,012 --> 01:09:45,014
(IN ENGLISH) A Spanish man
of faith cursed me.

1218
01:09:45,181 --> 01:09:47,058
As he died by my hand,

1219
01:09:47,225 --> 01:09:48,267
he called me...

1220
01:09:48,476 --> 01:09:49,644
(IN SPANISH)

1221
01:09:51,729 --> 01:09:52,897
(CHUCKLES)

1222
01:09:53,690 --> 01:09:55,900
(IN ENGLISH)
The child without love.

1223
01:09:56,442 --> 01:09:57,902
And I took my name from there.

1224
01:10:03,282 --> 01:10:04,992
""Namor."

1225
01:10:05,159 --> 01:10:07,995
Because I have no love
for the surface world.

1226
01:10:09,997 --> 01:10:12,083
Why are you telling me
all of this?

1227
01:10:13,501 --> 01:10:16,629
So that you can understand why
I have to kill the scientist.

1228
01:10:16,796 --> 01:10:18,381
What if we took her
to Wakanda?

1229
01:10:19,757 --> 01:10:20,967
Let us go.

1230
01:10:21,926 --> 01:10:23,386
I give you my word.

1231
01:10:23,553 --> 01:10:25,012
She will remain in my country.

1232
01:10:25,221 --> 01:10:26,681
I cannot risk that, Princess.

1233
01:10:26,848 --> 01:10:28,474
Then keep me instead.

1234
01:10:30,435 --> 01:10:32,061
I'd love to see your nation.

1235
01:10:33,396 --> 01:10:36,023
Well, you can't go
down there in that.

1236
01:10:38,067 --> 01:10:41,529
Hypothermia will grip you
almost instantaneously.

1237
01:10:41,696 --> 01:10:43,948
Your blood will become toxic

1238
01:10:44,031 --> 01:10:45,450
and the pressure of the ocean

1239
01:10:45,533 --> 01:10:47,952
will break every bone
in your body.

1240
01:10:51,038 --> 01:10:52,290
(IN LIGHT TONE)
Or you can wear a suit.

1241
01:10:52,707 --> 01:10:54,459
We have some of them. Come on.

1242
01:10:57,545 --> 01:10:58,546
Stay close.

1243
01:11:01,174 --> 01:11:03,384
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1244
01:11:51,891 --> 01:11:52,892
(YELPS)

1245
01:12:02,902 --> 01:12:04,570
SHURI: Hey! Namor, wait!

1246
01:12:25,216 --> 01:12:26,884
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

1247
01:12:40,064 --> 01:12:42,275
(WHALE SINGING)

1248
01:12:43,150 --> 01:12:45,319
(SOFT MUSIC INTRO PLAYING)

1249
01:12:49,615 --> 01:12:50,741
SHURI: Whoa!

1250
01:12:52,493 --> 01:12:54,871
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
PLAYING)

1251
01:12:58,416 --> 01:12:59,792
(GASPING IN AWE)

1252
01:13:35,244 --> 01:13:37,580
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1253
01:14:08,152 --> 01:14:09,612
Hello.

1254
01:14:15,117 --> 01:14:17,411
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1255
01:14:38,182 --> 01:14:39,308
It's beautiful.

1256
01:14:41,143 --> 01:14:42,478
It's made of vibranium.

1257
01:14:42,645 --> 01:14:43,646
NAMOR: Yes.

1258
01:14:43,729 --> 01:14:45,314
In the depths of the ocean,

1259
01:14:45,731 --> 01:14:47,984
I brought the sun
to my people.

1260
01:14:50,069 --> 01:14:51,195
I know you wished me

1261
01:14:51,278 --> 01:14:53,531
to spare the life
of the scientist.

1262
01:14:53,906 --> 01:14:56,158
But now you see
what I have to protect.

1263
01:14:58,077 --> 01:15:00,454
(CON LA BRISA BY FOUDEQUSH
CONTINUES)

1264
01:15:19,724 --> 01:15:20,891
(KIMOYO BEADS CHIRP)

1265
01:15:20,975 --> 01:15:23,060
GRIOT: (ON COMMS) Nakia,
your hunch was correct.

1266
01:15:23,227 --> 01:15:26,230
I have picked up a location
on Shuri's Kimoyo earrings.

1267
01:15:30,901 --> 01:15:33,112
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

1268
01:15:48,210 --> 01:15:49,420
(ENGINE HUMMING)

1269
01:15:59,597 --> 01:16:02,224
GRIOT: The signal is coming
from an underwater cavern

1270
01:16:02,391 --> 01:16:05,853
approximately 140 meters
below the surface.

1271
01:16:06,479 --> 01:16:08,773
Queen Mother,
I've found her signal.

1272
01:16:08,939 --> 01:16:11,067
It's coming
from an underwater cave.

1273
01:16:12,068 --> 01:16:13,069
If she's down there,

1274
01:16:13,152 --> 01:16:14,779
I'm sure
I'll encounter resistance.

1275
01:16:15,738 --> 01:16:17,656
How would you like me
to proceed?

1276
01:16:18,574 --> 01:16:22,953
Retrieve the princess
by any means necessary.

1277
01:16:23,120 --> 01:16:26,332
I will attempt
to draw Namor out.

1278
01:16:34,757 --> 01:16:36,509
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

1279
01:16:40,387 --> 01:16:42,389
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1280
01:17:01,242 --> 01:17:02,910
You are the first person
from the surface

1281
01:17:02,993 --> 01:17:04,495
to come to Talokan.

1282
01:17:05,496 --> 01:17:07,540
Please take this as a token
of our gratitude.

1283
01:17:14,713 --> 01:17:17,299
It was made with the plant
that saved Talokan.

1284
01:17:20,094 --> 01:17:21,470
You are young, Princess.

1285
01:17:22,346 --> 01:17:25,266
When you age as I do,
you realize

1286
01:17:25,432 --> 01:17:28,185
we all lose everyone we love.

1287
01:17:28,352 --> 01:17:29,937
But when I lost my brother,

1288
01:17:30,104 --> 01:17:31,730
it just felt different.

1289
01:17:31,897 --> 01:17:33,566
He suffered in silence.

1290
01:17:34,150 --> 01:17:37,153
When he finally asked me
to help him, I couldn't.

1291
01:17:38,237 --> 01:17:39,947
How does that make sense

1292
01:17:40,906 --> 01:17:44,577
that the ancestors would
give me gifts and skills

1293
01:17:44,743 --> 01:17:47,496
to help me save my brother,
and I couldn't?

1294
01:17:48,998 --> 01:17:49,999
Why?

1295
01:17:52,459 --> 01:17:54,962
I don't have an answer
for that question.

1296
01:17:57,089 --> 01:17:59,633
My ancestors would often say,

1297
01:18:00,009 --> 01:18:03,429
"Only the most broken people
can be great leaders."

1298
01:18:07,183 --> 01:18:09,351
I admire
what you have built here.

1299
01:18:11,645 --> 01:18:14,106
And how you've protected
your people.

1300
01:18:14,899 --> 01:18:17,943
But as princess of Wakanda,

1301
01:18:18,110 --> 01:18:20,571
I will not stand for you
killing that young woman.

1302
01:18:22,281 --> 01:18:25,367
My nation will not rest
until I'm returned.

1303
01:18:26,785 --> 01:18:28,913
I'm not leaving without her.

1304
01:18:29,663 --> 01:18:33,375
We need to find a peaceful way
to resolve this.

1305
01:18:37,046 --> 01:18:38,756
It is no longer
about the scientist.

1306
01:18:40,841 --> 01:18:42,468
For centuries,
the surface nations

1307
01:18:42,551 --> 01:18:45,346
have conquered and enslaved
people like us.

1308
01:18:46,013 --> 01:18:47,473
Over resources.

1309
01:18:48,891 --> 01:18:51,143
Since the day
I buried my mother,

1310
01:18:51,310 --> 01:18:52,937
I have prepared my people

1311
01:18:53,020 --> 01:18:55,147
for the time
they will come for us.

1312
01:18:55,314 --> 01:18:59,526
And that machine is the sign
that the time is now.

1313
01:19:01,403 --> 01:19:06,742
I need to know if Wakanda
is an ally or an enemy.

1314
01:19:07,159 --> 01:19:09,036
There is no in-between.

1315
01:19:11,163 --> 01:19:14,875
So you plan to wage war
on the entire world,

1316
01:19:15,459 --> 01:19:17,795
and you want Wakanda
to help you?

1317
01:19:18,712 --> 01:19:19,880
That's madness.

1318
01:19:20,047 --> 01:19:23,050
There isn't a nation
that wouldn't plunder Wakanda

1319
01:19:23,133 --> 01:19:24,677
if given a chance.

1320
01:19:26,011 --> 01:19:27,930
If we make an alliance,

1321
01:19:28,097 --> 01:19:30,808
we can protect each other
by striking them first.

1322
01:19:31,350 --> 01:19:35,604
Then, when the threat of these
nations has been eliminated,

1323
01:19:35,771 --> 01:19:38,399
the scientist will be returned
to Wakanda.

1324
01:19:38,816 --> 01:19:41,610
And if Wakanda
does not accept, what then?

1325
01:19:42,695 --> 01:19:44,655
The scientist will die.

1326
01:19:45,656 --> 01:19:48,575
And Wakanda will be
the first nation to fall.

1327
01:19:48,826 --> 01:19:50,369
An attack on my people?

1328
01:19:50,703 --> 01:19:52,162
Yes.

1329
01:19:52,329 --> 01:19:54,707
And I want you
to listen to me.

1330
01:19:54,873 --> 01:19:57,835
Wakanda cannot win a war
with Talokan.

1331
01:19:59,962 --> 01:20:01,839
(WATER SLOSHES)

1332
01:20:01,922 --> 01:20:03,215
(IN MAYAN)

1333
01:20:09,680 --> 01:20:11,890
(IN ENGLISH)
I heard you that night,

1334
01:20:11,974 --> 01:20:13,976
with your mother at the river.

1335
01:20:15,269 --> 01:20:18,022
You said you wanted
to burn the world.

1336
01:20:24,194 --> 01:20:25,696
Let us burn it together.

1337
01:20:29,950 --> 01:20:31,493
(WATER SLOSHING)

1338
01:20:34,330 --> 01:20:35,497
US SECRETARY OF STATE:
Queen Ramonda

1339
01:20:35,581 --> 01:20:37,249
won't sell us any vibranium.

1340
01:20:38,000 --> 01:20:39,543
And now they abducted
a young woman

1341
01:20:39,626 --> 01:20:40,878
who built the machine.

1342
01:20:41,045 --> 01:20:42,338
Yeah, with all due respect,

1343
01:20:42,421 --> 01:20:44,048
Riri Williams
is a child prodigy

1344
01:20:44,131 --> 01:20:46,342
who was running circles around
all of her professors.

1345
01:20:46,508 --> 01:20:47,968
The Wakandans
were recruiting her

1346
01:20:48,052 --> 01:20:49,386
as part of their
outreach program.

1347
01:20:49,553 --> 01:20:50,971
Nothing more. And then,

1348
01:20:51,138 --> 01:20:53,515
you guys send ina SWAT team
under cover of night

1349
01:20:53,682 --> 01:20:55,684
to arrest the Crown Princess

1350
01:20:55,768 --> 01:20:57,102
of an international
superpower.

1351
01:21:00,272 --> 01:21:01,940
The President wants
to take offensive action

1352
01:21:02,024 --> 01:21:03,067
against Wakanda.

1353
01:21:03,150 --> 01:21:04,401
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYS)

1354
01:21:04,485 --> 01:21:06,362
What type of offensive action?

1355
01:21:07,071 --> 01:21:08,614
Destabilization.

1356
01:21:09,782 --> 01:21:13,118
Well, Special Officer Ross
is our expert.

1357
01:21:13,285 --> 01:21:15,496
So, Ross, what do you think?

1358
01:21:15,662 --> 01:21:17,164
My sources are telling me

1359
01:21:17,247 --> 01:21:18,457
that there's someone else
out there.

1360
01:21:19,375 --> 01:21:21,293
-Another nation?
-ROSS: Could be. I don't know.

1361
01:21:21,377 --> 01:21:22,378
You've gotta give me
enough time

1362
01:21:22,461 --> 01:21:23,545
to investigate this properly,

1363
01:21:23,629 --> 01:21:25,756
otherwise we're gonna
find ourselves at war

1364
01:21:25,923 --> 01:21:27,758
with a country
whose military capacity

1365
01:21:27,841 --> 01:21:29,802
we can't even comprehend.

1366
01:21:31,387 --> 01:21:32,388
Director?

1367
01:21:32,846 --> 01:21:35,099
I think he's the expert.

1368
01:21:35,182 --> 01:21:38,185
I think it would be a mistake
to attack Wakanda.

1369
01:21:40,354 --> 01:21:41,772
(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL SOFTLY)

1370
01:21:44,983 --> 01:21:45,984
RAMONDA: (ON PHONE) Yes?

1371
01:21:46,068 --> 01:21:46,944
We have a problem.

1372
01:22:08,632 --> 01:22:10,968
Is my daughter alive?

1373
01:22:11,135 --> 01:22:13,095
The princess
is alive and well.

1374
01:22:13,804 --> 01:22:16,640
She requested
to be taken to Talokan.

1375
01:22:16,807 --> 01:22:19,184
She will remain there
for the time being.

1376
01:22:22,813 --> 01:22:26,066
What can I offer you
in exchange?

1377
01:22:26,483 --> 01:22:27,484
Nothing.

1378
01:22:27,943 --> 01:22:29,653
I beg to differ.

1379
01:22:29,820 --> 01:22:33,490
The Americans are preparing
to blame Wakanda

1380
01:22:33,574 --> 01:22:36,118
for your attack
on their mining ship.

1381
01:22:36,285 --> 01:22:39,246
Return my daughter
and the scientist

1382
01:22:39,413 --> 01:22:43,000
or I will inform them
of your existence.

1383
01:22:49,715 --> 01:22:51,842
If you tell the Americans
about us,

1384
01:22:53,343 --> 01:22:55,512
if you try to find us,

1385
01:22:56,597 --> 01:23:00,392
or if I discover a single
Wakandan ship in the ocean,

1386
01:23:01,185 --> 01:23:02,644
I will kill the princess.

1387
01:23:04,188 --> 01:23:05,981
I will come to Wakanda

1388
01:23:06,148 --> 01:23:08,108
and I will kill you.

1389
01:23:17,451 --> 01:23:18,494
So, what happened?

1390
01:23:20,370 --> 01:23:23,373
He wants to go to war
with the surface world,

1391
01:23:23,540 --> 01:23:25,334
and asked me to help him.

1392
01:23:29,838 --> 01:23:31,256
I need to think.

1393
01:23:32,132 --> 01:23:34,092
We ain't never
gettin' out of here.

1394
01:23:34,176 --> 01:23:36,178
(FAINT FOOTSTEPS)

1395
01:23:37,846 --> 01:23:39,806
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1396
01:23:43,143 --> 01:23:44,144
Ey!

1397
01:23:44,228 --> 01:23:46,271
-(GUN CHARGING)
-(TENSE MUSIC PLAYS)

1398
01:23:46,396 --> 01:23:47,397
(IN MAYA)

1399
01:23:51,485 --> 01:23:52,986
(GUN CHARGING)

1400
01:24:04,873 --> 01:24:06,291
(BREATHING SHAKILY)

1401
01:24:07,543 --> 01:24:08,544
Shuri...

1402
01:24:09,461 --> 01:24:11,046
(IN XHOSA)

1403
01:24:11,755 --> 01:24:12,756
(GUARD GRUNTS)

1404
01:24:12,839 --> 01:24:14,216
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1405
01:24:14,299 --> 01:24:15,592
(GROANING)

1406
01:24:15,676 --> 01:24:16,802
(IN ENGLISH) Are you okay?

1407
01:24:17,594 --> 01:24:18,971
Are you okay?

1408
01:24:19,221 --> 01:24:20,472
-Give me your Beads!
-Let's go.

1409
01:24:20,639 --> 01:24:22,015
Give me your Beads.
I can save her.

1410
01:24:22,099 --> 01:24:23,100
We have to go.

1411
01:24:23,267 --> 01:24:24,393
Shuri, I don't know
who this lady is,

1412
01:24:24,476 --> 01:24:25,561
but we need to listen to her.

1413
01:24:25,727 --> 01:24:26,895
Listen, I hit her
with a sonic round.

1414
01:24:27,062 --> 01:24:29,314
It is lethal from this distance.
There is no chance.

1415
01:24:29,398 --> 01:24:31,275
You don't understand.
This will mean war.

1416
01:24:31,441 --> 01:24:33,777
-We have to go.
-Wait!

1417
01:24:33,860 --> 01:24:35,737
(GASPING)

1418
01:24:36,780 --> 01:24:38,991
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1419
01:24:52,462 --> 01:24:54,298
(ENGINE HUMMING)

1420
01:25:01,972 --> 01:25:03,640
(RAMONDA GASPING EMOTIONALLY)

1421
01:25:04,600 --> 01:25:06,643
(SOFT MUSIC PLAYING)

1422
01:25:17,404 --> 01:25:18,405
Did they hurt you?

1423
01:25:18,488 --> 01:25:20,115
No. No.

1424
01:25:21,658 --> 01:25:22,868
Thank you.

1425
01:25:23,619 --> 01:25:24,870
(IN XHOSA)

1426
01:25:26,371 --> 01:25:27,581
-GRIOT.
-GRIOT: (IN ENGLISH) Yes, my Queen.

1427
01:25:27,664 --> 01:25:29,708
Return us to Wakanda at once.

1428
01:25:33,545 --> 01:25:34,796
(IN MAYAN)

1429
01:25:57,778 --> 01:25:58,862
(EXHALES)

1430
01:26:02,240 --> 01:26:03,325
(NAMOR SIGHS)

1431
01:26:15,337 --> 01:26:17,506
(SORROWFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1432
01:26:43,824 --> 01:26:45,909
(MUSIC BUILDING UP)

1433
01:26:48,870 --> 01:26:51,123
(FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING)

1434
01:27:19,901 --> 01:27:21,486
(RUMBLING)

1435
01:27:23,697 --> 01:27:25,449
(TALOKANIL REPEATING)

1436
01:27:27,826 --> 01:27:29,411
(TALOKANIL REPEATING)

1437
01:27:33,039 --> 01:27:34,207
(ECHOING)

1438
01:28:14,664 --> 01:28:16,875
(TALOKANIL REPEATING CHANT)

1439
01:28:19,002 --> 01:28:20,420
(REPEATS CHANT)

1440
01:28:26,635 --> 01:28:29,054
MAN: (IN ENGLISH) Princess,
it is good to have you back.

1441
01:28:29,596 --> 01:28:31,389
The city has been on edge
since you left.

1442
01:28:32,307 --> 01:28:33,308
Go.

1443
01:28:33,475 --> 01:28:36,061
Fortify the sonic barriers
for all waterways.

1444
01:28:36,228 --> 01:28:37,229
Princess?

1445
01:28:38,146 --> 01:28:39,147
Neka.

1446
01:28:41,107 --> 01:28:43,485
Thank the ancestors. Hmm?

1447
01:28:43,819 --> 01:28:47,030
I just wanted to return these.

1448
01:28:48,240 --> 01:28:50,408
No. Keep them.

1449
01:28:50,575 --> 01:28:52,077
Might need them soon.

1450
01:28:52,994 --> 01:28:54,996
Did you get that
from down there?

1451
01:28:57,958 --> 01:29:01,336
Is it true you saw
an underwater empire?

1452
01:29:02,587 --> 01:29:04,339
-Yes.
-ANEKA: Hmm.

1453
01:29:05,006 --> 01:29:06,591
It is beautiful.

1454
01:29:07,843 --> 01:29:10,470
But these people
are dangerous, Aneka.

1455
01:29:10,971 --> 01:29:12,013
ANEKA: Mm.

1456
01:29:19,855 --> 01:29:21,982
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1457
01:29:30,657 --> 01:29:33,451
RAMONDA: So,
Miss Riri Williams,

1458
01:29:34,202 --> 01:29:36,371
what do you think of Wakanda?

1459
01:29:36,538 --> 01:29:38,540
The stories just don't do
this place justice.

1460
01:29:38,623 --> 01:29:39,708
(RAMONDA CHUCKLES)

1461
01:29:41,668 --> 01:29:42,711
It's great.

1462
01:29:42,878 --> 01:29:44,629
But I really
would like to go home.

1463
01:29:46,089 --> 01:29:47,674
You will need to be patient.

1464
01:29:47,841 --> 01:29:49,885
Can I at least call my mom?

1465
01:29:50,552 --> 01:29:51,720
(INHALES SHARPLY)

1466
01:29:52,596 --> 01:29:54,097
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

1467
01:29:56,308 --> 01:29:57,726
SOLDIER: The Princess
has been brought home

1468
01:29:57,809 --> 01:29:59,603
by the War Dog Nakia.

1469
01:29:59,769 --> 01:30:01,146
Glory to Hanuman.

1470
01:30:01,229 --> 01:30:02,689
SOLDIERS: Glory to Hanuman.

1471
01:30:02,772 --> 01:30:07,319
Mm. The spy saves Wakanda
once again.

1472
01:30:07,903 --> 01:30:09,362
The Queen will reward her

1473
01:30:09,529 --> 01:30:12,032
with lifetime banishment.
I'm sure of it.

1474
01:30:12,115 --> 01:30:13,909
(ALL LAUGHING)

1475
01:30:14,492 --> 01:30:15,952
Okoye.

1476
01:30:18,413 --> 01:30:19,414
(IN XHOSA)

1477
01:30:21,583 --> 01:30:22,834
OKOYE: (IN ENGLISH)
After Thanos' attack,

1478
01:30:23,293 --> 01:30:25,420
when you left
without saying a word,

1479
01:30:26,046 --> 01:30:27,213
it hurt.

1480
01:30:31,176 --> 01:30:34,596
I regret not being there
with all of you.

1481
01:30:36,097 --> 01:30:37,390
It was not easy.

1482
01:30:38,183 --> 01:30:39,184
He was...

1483
01:30:39,851 --> 01:30:43,688
King and Black Panther
to everyone.

1484
01:30:44,356 --> 01:30:46,524
But to me... (BREATH SHUDDERS)

1485
01:30:46,608 --> 01:30:47,859
(SIGHS)

1486
01:30:52,280 --> 01:30:53,990
he was everything.

1487
01:30:55,867 --> 01:30:57,827
My T'Challa.

1488
01:30:59,162 --> 01:31:02,123
When he was taken away
from me, just like that, I...

1489
01:31:02,874 --> 01:31:04,751
I had to step away

1490
01:31:05,669 --> 01:31:07,295
and let myself break.

1491
01:31:09,965 --> 01:31:11,174
I couldn't just...

1492
01:31:12,133 --> 01:31:15,512
keep going as if nothing
had happened, you know.

1493
01:31:16,346 --> 01:31:18,306
OKOYE: Mm-hmm. (SIGHS)

1494
01:31:19,391 --> 01:31:21,393
(PEOPLE CLAMORING)

1495
01:31:33,321 --> 01:31:34,322
We are under attack.

1496
01:31:34,406 --> 01:31:35,949
-(EXPLOSION)
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

1497
01:31:37,826 --> 01:31:38,952
(EXPLOSION)

1498
01:31:40,996 --> 01:31:42,122
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1499
01:31:42,205 --> 01:31:43,289
Here.

1500
01:31:47,419 --> 01:31:49,045
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

1501
01:31:50,130 --> 01:31:51,131
(IN XHOSA)

1502
01:31:51,965 --> 01:31:53,633
(IN ENGLISH) Are you okay?
Are you all right?

1503
01:31:53,717 --> 01:31:55,593
GRIOT, activate the Sunbird.

1504
01:31:55,760 --> 01:31:56,928
Shuri, where are you?

1505
01:31:57,095 --> 01:31:58,555
Making my way
to the city right now.

1506
01:31:58,722 --> 01:32:00,181
Stand down! That is an order!

1507
01:32:00,348 --> 01:32:02,642
Mother, I'm with Aneka.
We can provide air support.

1508
01:32:02,809 --> 01:32:04,185
RAMONDA: (ON COMMS) Aneka,
do not let her leave the lab.

1509
01:32:04,269 --> 01:32:05,353
Mother, you're...
you're breaking up.

1510
01:32:05,437 --> 01:32:06,438
-We can't hear you.
-RAMONDA: Shuri!

1511
01:32:06,521 --> 01:32:07,522
Love you. Bye!

1512
01:32:07,605 --> 01:32:09,774
-(CALL DISCONNECTS)
-(RAMONDA GASPS)

1513
01:32:09,858 --> 01:32:10,942
You just hung up on the Queen.

1514
01:32:11,109 --> 01:32:12,110
I just hung up on my mom.

1515
01:32:12,277 --> 01:32:13,862
There's a difference.
Come. Let's go!

1516
01:32:19,159 --> 01:32:20,326
(MAN GRUNTS)

1517
01:32:21,619 --> 01:32:23,246
(BOTH PANTING)

1518
01:32:25,665 --> 01:32:27,542
(HIGH-PITCHED WHISTLE)

1519
01:32:29,252 --> 01:32:31,254
(TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1520
01:32:31,713 --> 01:32:33,214
(ORCA CLICKING)

1521
01:32:37,552 --> 01:32:40,055
(TALOKANIL WOMEN
HARMONIZING MELODIOUSLY)

1522
01:32:46,102 --> 01:32:48,188
(LOUDLY) Invaders!

1523
01:32:53,777 --> 01:32:56,988
-(PANICKED CHATTER)
-Mama! Mama!

1524
01:32:57,072 --> 01:32:58,198
(SCREAMS)

1525
01:32:59,908 --> 01:33:00,992
(IN XHOSA)

1526
01:33:02,535 --> 01:33:05,330
(MELODIOUS HARMONIZING
CONTINUES)

1527
01:33:05,413 --> 01:33:06,414
GRIOT: (IN ENGLISH)
EMTs are suffering

1528
01:33:06,498 --> 01:33:08,291
a form of sonic hypnosis.

1529
01:33:08,374 --> 01:33:09,751
(PANICKED SHOUTING)

1530
01:33:11,002 --> 01:33:12,128
(IN XHOSA)

1531
01:33:12,295 --> 01:33:14,130
RAMONDA: (IN ENGLISH)
General, plug your ears.

1532
01:33:14,297 --> 01:33:15,381
Yes, my Queen.

1533
01:33:18,176 --> 01:33:19,302
(AYO YELLS)

1534
01:33:19,844 --> 01:33:20,929
(GRUNTS)

1535
01:33:21,638 --> 01:33:23,223
(ALL SCREAMING)

1536
01:33:34,651 --> 01:33:35,944
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

1537
01:33:42,075 --> 01:33:43,576
(BOTH GRUNTING)

1538
01:33:46,996 --> 01:33:48,039
(ALL SCREAMING)

1539
01:33:51,417 --> 01:33:52,418
(YELLS)

1540
01:33:52,502 --> 01:33:53,753
(WARRIOR SCREAMS)

1541
01:33:55,088 --> 01:33:56,422
(GRUNTS)

1542
01:34:01,803 --> 01:34:03,930
-Can I help?
-Come, quickly.

1543
01:34:10,854 --> 01:34:12,397
(ATTUMA SPEAKING MAYAN)

1544
01:34:12,605 --> 01:34:13,690
(AX CLANGS)

1545
01:34:14,524 --> 01:34:15,608
(IN ENGLISH)
Cross your arms...

1546
01:34:15,692 --> 01:34:16,693
(IN XHOSA)

1547
01:34:17,026 --> 01:34:18,111
(BOY WHIMPERS)

1548
01:34:21,364 --> 01:34:22,365
Nakia.

1549
01:34:22,448 --> 01:34:23,700
(IN XHOSA)

1550
01:34:25,243 --> 01:34:27,370
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING)

1551
01:34:36,754 --> 01:34:38,047
(IN ENGLISH) The fish man.

1552
01:34:42,343 --> 01:34:43,553
(IN MAYAN)

1553
01:34:49,684 --> 01:34:50,977
(M'BAKU GRUNTS)

1554
01:35:00,862 --> 01:35:02,030
(ARMOR CRACKS)

1555
01:35:04,490 --> 01:35:05,617
(GRUNTS)

1556
01:35:06,576 --> 01:35:08,620
(GASPING FOR BREATH)

1557
01:35:10,455 --> 01:35:12,081
(ROUSING MUSIC PLAYING)

1558
01:35:13,166 --> 01:35:14,167
AYO: Phambili!

1559
01:35:15,835 --> 01:35:17,545
(WARRIORS GRUNTING)

1560
01:35:19,839 --> 01:35:21,132
(GRUNTING)

1561
01:35:26,221 --> 01:35:27,222
(YELLS)

1562
01:35:28,348 --> 01:35:30,350
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1563
01:35:31,643 --> 01:35:32,810
(ALARM BEEPING)

1564
01:35:34,354 --> 01:35:35,355
(NAMOR GROANS)

1565
01:35:45,406 --> 01:35:46,407
(NAMOR GRUNTS)

1566
01:35:48,451 --> 01:35:50,703
-(NAMOR GRUNTS)
-(SOLDIERS WHIMPER)

1567
01:35:51,246 --> 01:35:52,247
(YELLS)

1568
01:35:52,914 --> 01:35:53,998
(BOTH YELPING)

1569
01:36:03,174 --> 01:36:04,425
(GRUNTING)

1570
01:36:06,511 --> 01:36:07,512
(IN XHOSA)

1571
01:36:18,106 --> 01:36:19,524
(FIRING)

1572
01:36:26,406 --> 01:36:27,448
(IN ENGLISH)
Shit, he's too fast.

1573
01:36:27,532 --> 01:36:28,533
He's even faster in the water.

1574
01:36:46,301 --> 01:36:47,302
(BOTH YELL)

1575
01:36:50,054 --> 01:36:51,431
(ENGINE WHINES)

1576
01:36:54,434 --> 01:36:55,935
-Activating system override.
-SHURI: No.

1577
01:36:56,019 --> 01:36:57,020
-Wait! I'll fix it.
-(ALARMS BEEPING)

1578
01:36:57,103 --> 01:36:58,688
-Can't leave you here, Shuri!
-(GRUNTS ANGRILY)

1579
01:37:09,240 --> 01:37:11,492
(YELLS, GROWLS)

1580
01:37:15,496 --> 01:37:16,497
OKOYE: Do you see her?

1581
01:37:16,581 --> 01:37:17,957
Yes. Right there.

1582
01:37:18,041 --> 01:37:19,709
(BREATH SHUDDERING)

1583
01:37:19,792 --> 01:37:21,961
(UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING)

1584
01:37:25,882 --> 01:37:27,091
(PANTING)

1585
01:37:31,471 --> 01:37:33,139
-Go, child.
-(BREATHING SHAKILY)

1586
01:37:33,931 --> 01:37:35,475
Wait, what?
And leave you here?

1587
01:37:35,558 --> 01:37:36,559
Run!

1588
01:37:36,642 --> 01:37:38,644
(SHOUTS IN MAYAN)

1589
01:37:40,480 --> 01:37:41,606
(SCREAMS)

1590
01:37:41,689 --> 01:37:42,774
(RIRI SCREAMS)

1591
01:37:42,857 --> 01:37:44,567
(SCREAM ECHOING)

1592
01:37:50,073 --> 01:37:51,157
(GRUNTS)

1593
01:37:51,240 --> 01:37:52,700
Okoye, move now!

1594
01:37:56,954 --> 01:37:58,956
(WATER GURGLING)

1595
01:38:49,757 --> 01:38:51,092
(BOTH PANTING)

1596
01:38:53,678 --> 01:38:54,679
(IN XHOSA)

1597
01:38:55,012 --> 01:38:56,556
(SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING)

1598
01:39:00,435 --> 01:39:01,519
(IN ENGLISH) She did this.

1599
01:39:05,565 --> 01:39:06,732
In one week's time,

1600
01:39:06,816 --> 01:39:09,485
I will return
with my entire army

1601
01:39:09,652 --> 01:39:12,905
and you will join us
against the surface world,

1602
01:39:13,072 --> 01:39:16,033
or I will wash Wakanda
from the face of the Earth.

1603
01:39:16,993 --> 01:39:17,994
(OKOYE SPEAKING XHOSA)

1604
01:39:18,995 --> 01:39:19,996
(IN ENGLISH) Mother.

1605
01:39:20,455 --> 01:39:22,165
-Keep her back!
-Mother!

1606
01:39:22,498 --> 01:39:25,209
-Mama! Mama!
-Bury your dead.

1607
01:39:25,960 --> 01:39:27,503
Mourn your losses.

1608
01:39:27,587 --> 01:39:28,671
(CRYING)

1609
01:39:30,840 --> 01:39:32,425
You are queen now.

1610
01:39:32,675 --> 01:39:33,676
Mother!

1611
01:39:34,385 --> 01:39:35,386
No!

1612
01:39:38,556 --> 01:39:40,099
Get off of me!
Mother!

1613
01:39:40,850 --> 01:39:42,727
Mama!

1614
01:39:43,644 --> 01:39:45,646
(KIMOYO BEADS ZAPPING)

1615
01:39:47,523 --> 01:39:49,484
(GAGS, COUGHS)

1616
01:39:49,567 --> 01:39:51,611
Mama! (CONTINUES CRYING)

1617
01:39:51,694 --> 01:39:53,112
Mama!

1618
01:39:53,696 --> 01:39:54,864
Mother!

1619
01:39:55,573 --> 01:39:56,699
(IN XHOSA)

1620
01:39:56,782 --> 01:39:58,201
(SOBBING)

1621
01:39:58,618 --> 01:39:59,744
(NAKIA SPEAKING)

1622
01:40:02,413 --> 01:40:03,748
(IN ENGLISH) Help me!

1623
01:40:03,915 --> 01:40:05,208
Mama!

1624
01:40:05,583 --> 01:40:07,418
(CONTINUES SOBBING)

1625
01:40:08,711 --> 01:40:09,879
(IN XHOSA)

1626
01:40:12,715 --> 01:40:14,842
-SHURI: (IN ENGLISH) Mama!
-(OKOYE SOBBING)

1627
01:40:14,926 --> 01:40:17,136
(SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES)

1628
01:40:17,970 --> 01:40:19,931
(SHURI CONTINUES SOBBING)

1629
01:40:24,977 --> 01:40:27,230
(MOURNFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

1630
01:40:55,550 --> 01:41:00,721
Jabariland offers you
their comfort for your loss.

1631
01:41:07,353 --> 01:41:09,021
You must mourn her

1632
01:41:09,188 --> 01:41:13,109
in accordance to the rituals
of your ancestors.

1633
01:41:15,069 --> 01:41:16,904
Do not bury yourself
in your technology.

1634
01:41:17,071 --> 01:41:18,322
Why are you here?

1635
01:41:20,199 --> 01:41:21,909
I promised your brother

1636
01:41:22,076 --> 01:41:24,370
that I would provide you
with counsel

1637
01:41:24,537 --> 01:41:25,955
and protection.

1638
01:41:28,416 --> 01:41:30,626
But I am in need
of your advice today.

1639
01:41:34,463 --> 01:41:36,215
Your tribal elders
have approached me

1640
01:41:36,299 --> 01:41:38,092
with a proposition.

1641
01:41:39,510 --> 01:41:42,763
They wish to evacuate the city
and set up camp

1642
01:41:42,930 --> 01:41:44,432
in Jabariland.

1643
01:41:44,599 --> 01:41:47,768
So, now you are keen
to hear from a child

1644
01:41:48,436 --> 01:41:50,104
who scoffs at tradition?

1645
01:41:51,105 --> 01:41:52,148
M'BAKU: Mm.

1646
01:41:54,317 --> 01:41:55,318
The world...

1647
01:41:57,236 --> 01:41:59,905
The world has taken
too much from you

1648
01:42:00,656 --> 01:42:03,909
for you to still be
considered a child.

1649
01:42:07,038 --> 01:42:08,956
It is in my people's interest
to know

1650
01:42:09,040 --> 01:42:11,500
which way your mind
is leaning.

1651
01:42:13,377 --> 01:42:15,087
The elders are desperate.

1652
01:42:16,714 --> 01:42:18,633
The city is vulnerable.

1653
01:42:20,843 --> 01:42:23,012
If you are to provide
for them,

1654
01:42:24,138 --> 01:42:26,390
they will be
in great debt to you.

1655
01:42:28,476 --> 01:42:30,186
And what of your heart?

1656
01:42:31,312 --> 01:42:32,313
Hmm?

1657
01:42:33,731 --> 01:42:35,733
Which way
is your heart leaning?

1658
01:42:37,610 --> 01:42:40,571
I just buried the last person
who truly knew me.

1659
01:42:44,075 --> 01:42:45,743
My heart was buried with her.

1660
01:42:59,632 --> 01:43:00,633
(SIGHS)

1661
01:43:20,569 --> 01:43:21,779
(BOTTLE LID TURNING)

1662
01:43:21,862 --> 01:43:23,739
DE FONTAINE: (SNIFFS) Oh, man.

1663
01:43:24,615 --> 01:43:26,534
Yeah, your olive oil's
about to go bad.

1664
01:43:26,701 --> 01:43:27,702
What...
What are you doing here?

1665
01:43:27,868 --> 01:43:30,538
I'm hungry. And...

1666
01:43:30,955 --> 01:43:32,957
Tragedy strikes
the international community.

1667
01:43:33,040 --> 01:43:34,208
Sources can now confirm

1668
01:43:34,291 --> 01:43:37,253
that Queen Ramonda,
daughter of Lumumba, has died.

1669
01:43:37,878 --> 01:43:39,463
Western allies say
that civil conflict

1670
01:43:39,547 --> 01:43:41,590
was the likely cause
of the Queen's...

1671
01:43:41,674 --> 01:43:43,259
-(TV SHUTS)
-(SETS DOWN REMOTE)

1672
01:43:44,135 --> 01:43:45,136
So...

1673
01:43:45,511 --> 01:43:46,846
You have any comment?

1674
01:43:46,929 --> 01:43:48,931
(UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING)

1675
01:43:49,014 --> 01:43:52,184
I wonder what else your
friends are keeping from you.

1676
01:43:52,393 --> 01:43:54,019
(HESITATES)
What are you talking about?

1677
01:43:54,186 --> 01:43:57,690
I have no unsanctioned contact
with the kingdom of Wakanda.

1678
01:43:57,773 --> 01:43:58,941
(CHUCKLES)

1679
01:44:00,109 --> 01:44:02,278
What about the Beads?

1680
01:44:02,570 --> 01:44:04,572
(SCOFFS) What?

1681
01:44:04,739 --> 01:44:05,740
The Beads.

1682
01:44:05,906 --> 01:44:07,032
I had them bugged

1683
01:44:07,199 --> 01:44:08,868
before you
ever even got there.

1684
01:44:09,034 --> 01:44:12,872
l've been privy to every
conversation you've had,

1685
01:44:12,955 --> 01:44:15,624
including that treasonous call
with the Queen.

1686
01:44:15,791 --> 01:44:17,168
May she rest in peace.

1687
01:44:17,585 --> 01:44:18,878
But it's good.

1688
01:44:19,044 --> 01:44:20,087
Well, for us.

1689
01:44:20,254 --> 01:44:22,965
All right. You know what?
The Wakandans saved my life.

1690
01:44:23,466 --> 01:44:25,092
-They're a good people.
-Mm-hmm.

1691
01:44:25,176 --> 01:44:27,219
You ever thought
for a second

1692
01:44:27,386 --> 01:44:29,013
what they could be doing?

1693
01:44:29,180 --> 01:44:30,598
Ever thought
what we would be doing

1694
01:44:30,681 --> 01:44:33,893
if the US was the only country
in the world with vibranium?

1695
01:44:34,143 --> 01:44:38,439
Oh, I actually dream
about that.

1696
01:44:41,275 --> 01:44:42,943
Val. Val, please.

1697
01:44:43,319 --> 01:44:44,945
It's Director de Fontaine.

1698
01:44:47,823 --> 01:44:50,993
Your mother protected me
like I was one of her own.

1699
01:44:52,286 --> 01:44:54,747
The least that I could do
is try to return the favor.

1700
01:44:57,082 --> 01:44:59,460
We need to find a way
to weaken Namor.

1701
01:44:59,627 --> 01:45:01,796
Even weakened,
he's still gonna be a problem.

1702
01:45:01,962 --> 01:45:05,382
The Black Panther has never
failed to protect Wakanda.

1703
01:45:06,133 --> 01:45:08,135
I thought
the Black Panther was gone.

1704
01:45:17,853 --> 01:45:19,188
My brother is dead.

1705
01:45:20,940 --> 01:45:23,526
But it doesn't mean
the Black Panther is gone.

1706
01:45:24,026 --> 01:45:26,028
(PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING)

1707
01:45:41,293 --> 01:45:42,837
GRIOT?

1708
01:45:43,003 --> 01:45:45,631
Let's start by running
a comparative analysis

1709
01:45:45,798 --> 01:45:47,591
between our attempts
at creating

1710
01:45:47,675 --> 01:45:49,385
a synthetic
Heart-Shaped Herb...

1711
01:45:52,096 --> 01:45:54,056
and the fibers
from this bracelet.

1712
01:45:54,640 --> 01:45:55,933
GRIOT: Yes, Princess.

1713
01:45:59,228 --> 01:46:01,981
Since this was grown
from vibranium-rich soil,

1714
01:46:03,232 --> 01:46:05,484
they may share
some base-level similarities

1715
01:46:05,568 --> 01:46:06,694
that we can exploit.

1716
01:46:06,861 --> 01:46:08,153
GRIOT: As you wish, Princess.

1717
01:46:09,780 --> 01:46:11,782
(ALONE BY BURNA BOY PLAYING)

1718
01:46:12,449 --> 01:46:14,869
Please upload
my brother's DNA also.

1719
01:46:15,035 --> 01:46:16,161
GRIOT: Uploading now.

1720
01:46:32,761 --> 01:46:34,889
Who do I turn to

1721
01:46:35,514 --> 01:46:37,141
When I need saving

1722
01:46:37,808 --> 01:46:39,977
'Cause you move mountain

